#10221
Temple of the Sun~
   You stand upon a beautiful, open-roofed temple, seemingly untouched by the
ages that have decimated the rest of the Citadel. The temple walls and floor
tiles are interlaid with veins of polished bronze which catch and reflect the
light, throwing off intense beams in all directions. A high altar stands at the
very center of the raised platform.
~
