#10259
A Roadway through the Citadel~
   You have reached a junction on the Citadel roadway. To the west, a series
of low steps lead upward to a bronze-trimmed gateway, apparently leading to
a rather formal space within the city. To the east, a more humble structure
stands. The Citadel roadway continues to the north and south.
