#10260
The Stables~
   You stand within what must have served as stables for the knights of this
once-lively Citadel. The remains of ancient tack and harness hang from pegs
or lie heaped on the dirt floor - the silver tarnished; the leather cracked and
peeling. The Citadel Roadway lies to the west, and a large wooden gate stands
at the rear of the stables.
~
