#10261
A Poor Dirt Pathway~
   You arrive at the southern end of a narrow path that winds down from the
north, amid the twisted remains of modest homes. To the west, a large gate
opens onto the city stable. Perhaps some of the residents here were responsible
for the care of the Citadel stock. To the south, a small stone structure
appears to have served as the local holding cell. The entrance is affixed with
a small door formed from heavy iron bars.
