The Wine Stores~
   Great winecasks, covered in ages of dust and decay once filled this space,
stacked to the ceiling. Now, the upper casks have shifted into precarious
position, due to the crushing of the casks at the lower levels. Perhaps you
shouldn't stand here for long. They may yet be quite unstable.
