The Peristyle~
   You pass through the yard, taking note of the ancient artwork - colorful
representations of humans and gods still visible in patches along the walls.
The clay-coated, adobe floor now bare, echos your footfalls throughout this
barren space. The yard extends to the north and east, and a small alcove lies
to the south.
