#10266
Gateway to the Abandoned Citadel~
   The massive gates before you, now crushed beyond all repair, bear a crest
that stirs a vague memory in your mind. As your gaze drifts past them to the
abandoned roadway, you are suddenly reminded of a tale from your childhood - of
the great Citadel of Solamnia, vanquished and banished to the barren lands by
the forces of the black coven. The Citadel roadway lies to the north, while
in the distance to the south, the black winds roar.
~
