#10267
The Gateguard's House~
   Just within the massive city gates, you come upon the standing remains of
the Citadel guardhouse. From this small space, the officers on duty would have
been responsible for ensuring that visitors to the citadel were admissible.
The Citadel roadway lies to the west.
~
