An Alcove off the Peristyle~
   Within this small chamber, you find only a small opening in the floor,
affixed with a wooden ladder. Gazing down into the blackness, you wonder if
the structure is solid enough to hold your weight. A collapse in a shaft this
size could easily prove fatal. The peristyle yard lies through the doorway
to the north.
