The Guard's Commandpost~
   You enter what was once the stronghold of the Citadel's Captain. The walls
here are covered in the torn remains of maps, and the table is littered with
the decaying remains of old parchments - perhaps the treaties of bygone days.
An arched passageway opens to the west, and a small key-way opens to the south.
