A Desert Oasis~
   A well of water springs forth from deep within the desert. A few ragged
palms and shrubs huddle near the life-giving pool, but the harsh sun keeps
anything from flourishing beyond a tight ring of green growth. Tracks of many
unidentifiable animals can be seen near the edge of the water.
